      story: "Wanpi is a roughly one-year-old native mix boy who, after being rescued, finally got to flash a big grin in the sunshine. Don't let the name \"mischievous\" fool you—he's actually gentle and well-behaved, a little guarded with people he's just met, but he slowly lets his walls down and turns sweet and affectionate once he trusts you. He's waiting for a family willing to give him a bit of extra patience, to walk with him from stranger to friend and fill his days with sunshine.",
